Package: eyeofmx
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: Zenobia <zenobia@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Native GTK 3 monitoring and security inspector for all Linux
 Created by Zenobia. For NT Protection.
 .
 EyeOFmX shows active sockets, listening ports, owning processes, critical
 /etc files, live activity, shell command history, structured findings
 from installed security tools and a brief comprehensive posture report
 aggregating rootkit, malware, integrity and suspicious-file checks.
 Optional scanning engines can be installed through an explicit, authenticated
 prompt using the correct packages for the detected distribution.
 .
 It works across common Linux distributions. The interface is native GTK 3
 and every collector is read-only;
 installing tools is a separate confirmed action.
